1
00:01:23,600 --> 00:01:25,200
Okay, okay.

2
00:01:25,280 --> 00:01:27,840
Okay. I'm at Auem's buffalo pen now.

3
00:01:27,920 --> 00:01:31,520
Okay, Dad. Let's video call.

4
00:01:31,600 --> 00:01:33,200
I'll start a video call then.

5
00:01:35,680 --> 00:01:37,440
Look, Hom Ngern.

6
00:01:37,520 --> 00:01:42,080
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">Hom Ngern, Sia Aun won't let me</font></font></i>
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">take Hom Thong Home.</font></font></i>

7
00:01:42,160 --> 00:01:45,000
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">I need you to come with Din's dad, okay?</font></font></i>

8
00:01:45,080 --> 00:01:47,000
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">Let's go bring Hom Thong home.</font></font></i>

9
00:01:51,760 --> 00:01:53,600
Yeah, yeah.

10
00:01:53,680 --> 00:01:55,440
Okay? Got it?

11
00:01:55,520 --> 00:01:56,960
Okay, I'll hang up now.

12
00:01:58,360 --> 00:02:01,200
Easy there, Hom Ngern.

13
00:02:01,280 --> 00:02:05,040
The truck's backing up for you now.
You're going to go get your son back.

14
00:02:05,120 --> 00:02:06,720
Got it? Hmm?

15
00:02:12,480 --> 00:02:14,640
Have you called a truck
to pick up Hom Thong?

16
00:02:14,720 --> 00:02:16,000
Yes, boss.

17
00:02:16,080 --> 00:02:19,200
It'll be here at 5 p.m.
Then they'll move him to the border.

18
00:02:19,280 --> 00:02:20,680
Make sure it goes smoothly.

19
00:02:21,320 --> 00:02:24,360
Our client has already paid
five million for Hom Thong.

20
00:02:24,880 --> 00:02:26,880
-There must be no mistake.
-Yes, boss.

21
00:02:32,440 --> 00:02:33,720
Sorry about that.

22
00:02:34,640 --> 00:02:36,320
There's no way you're going home.

23
00:02:42,920 --> 00:02:43,760
BEAUTY QUEEN SA-ING'S MEATBALLS

24
00:02:44,400 --> 00:02:46,040
FRESHLY MADE MEATBALLS
NO PRESERVATIVES

25
00:02:46,120 --> 00:02:48,080
Gee, that's enough!

26
00:02:48,160 --> 00:02:50,480
Leave something for the customer to chew!

27
00:02:51,840 --> 00:02:52,800
Ugh.

28
00:02:52,880 --> 00:02:54,040
Well, I'm mad!

29
00:02:54,120 --> 00:02:56,560
Wish I could chop Sia Aun
into little pieces like this!

30
00:02:56,640 --> 00:02:58,280
Don't get me started.

31
00:02:58,360 --> 00:03:01,080
What kind of person
bullies kids that can't even fight back?

32
00:03:02,760 --> 00:03:03,840
Yod.

33
00:03:04,480 --> 00:03:06,520
Please help our kids.

34
00:03:06,600 --> 00:03:09,440
Bring Hom Thong home. Do you hear me?

35
00:03:09,520 --> 00:03:12,280
Yes, Dad. You've got to help Auem

36
00:03:12,360 --> 00:03:14,640
so I can make Hom Ngern
and Hom Thong merch.

37
00:03:16,480 --> 00:03:18,080
What merch, dear?

38
00:03:18,160 --> 00:03:20,800
I looked at other buffalo pages online.

39
00:03:20,880 --> 00:03:23,800
-They all sell cute merch.
-Oh.

40
00:03:23,880 --> 00:03:27,000
So I used ChatGPT to design logos
for Hom Ngern and Hom Thong.

41
00:03:27,080 --> 00:03:29,320
-Hmm.
-Maybe we can use them to make some merch.

42
00:03:29,400 --> 00:03:31,320
Yeah? That's great.

43
00:03:31,400 --> 00:03:35,240
Who's this ChatGPD though?

44
00:03:36,440 --> 00:03:39,520
It's an AI program
that can help you with many things.

45
00:03:39,600 --> 00:03:41,320
-Oh?
-It's a program. A program.

46
00:03:41,400 --> 00:03:43,000
-Not a person?
-Not a person.

47
00:03:43,080 --> 00:03:45,840
-Can I see your designs, Orn?
-Sure.

48
00:03:49,480 --> 00:03:50,600
Here.

49
00:03:50,680 --> 00:03:51,520
-Whoa.
-Wow.

50
00:03:51,600 --> 00:03:53,800
-Super cute!
-So cute!

51
00:03:53,880 --> 00:03:55,760
-So cute! So pretty!
-Yeah.

52
00:03:55,840 --> 00:03:58,760
Having these on our glasses,
shirts, and keychains

53
00:03:58,840 --> 00:04:00,960
-can make our merch worth more.
-That's true.

54
00:04:01,040 --> 00:04:01,880
Yeah.

55
00:04:01,960 --> 00:04:04,360
I've been thinking.
If Auem can bring Hom Thong home,

56
00:04:04,440 --> 00:04:06,240
I'll ask her to choose the best design.

57
00:04:07,040 --> 00:04:07,880
-Well done.
-And

58
00:04:07,960 --> 00:04:10,480
have you talked to the shop
that makes these yet?

59
00:04:10,560 --> 00:04:13,840
-Not yet.
-I'll take you then.

60
00:04:13,920 --> 00:04:16,920
We can ask how much they'll charge
and give Auem a quote. How about that?

61
00:04:17,519 --> 00:04:18,519
Thank you.

62
00:04:20,240 --> 00:04:21,720
-Meatballs, please.
-Oh, meatballs.

63
00:04:21,800 --> 00:04:23,280
CHOK CHAROENSUK FARM

64
00:04:28,440 --> 00:04:31,120
Feel free to check out our catalog.

65
00:04:31,200 --> 00:04:33,920
Our shop can make all kinds of designs.

66
00:04:34,000 --> 00:04:37,520
And we have different sizes and prices

67
00:04:37,600 --> 00:04:40,680
for that canvas bag you're interested in.

68
00:04:40,760 --> 00:04:42,560
Thanks. I think we'll have a look.

69
00:04:49,960 --> 00:04:50,880
This is nice.

70
00:04:55,840 --> 00:04:56,680
Whoa!

71
00:04:58,360 --> 00:05:00,920
CHOK CHAROENSUK FARM

72
00:05:01,960 --> 00:05:04,320
-This is…
-What is it, Rung?

73
00:05:05,280 --> 00:05:06,600
CHOK CHAROENSUK FARM

74
00:05:06,680 --> 00:05:09,200
It looks just like the merch
from Sia Aun's farm!

75
00:05:10,840 --> 00:05:12,120
-Which one?
-This one!

76
00:05:12,200 --> 00:05:13,040
This?

77
00:05:16,480 --> 00:05:18,320
That rings a bell.

78
00:05:18,400 --> 00:05:20,640
Auem once asked if any of us at home

79
00:05:20,720 --> 00:05:23,600
dropped this in Hom Thong's pen.

80
00:05:23,680 --> 00:05:24,560
Excuse me.

81
00:05:25,640 --> 00:05:27,560
Why are there two different designs?

82
00:05:28,160 --> 00:05:30,640
Oh, this one wasn't made for sale.

83
00:05:30,720 --> 00:05:32,880
Sia Aun had it made
just for his farm staff.

84
00:05:37,400 --> 00:05:38,760
What's the matter, Rung?

85
00:05:38,840 --> 00:05:41,040
The keychain we found in Hom Thong's pen

86
00:05:41,120 --> 00:05:43,240
has some human blood on it.

87
00:05:44,000 --> 00:05:47,720
So we suspected
someone had snuck into the pen

88
00:05:47,800 --> 00:05:49,680
the night Uncle Yod passed.

89
00:05:50,800 --> 00:05:54,000
If Sia Aun's men
have a keychain like this,

90
00:05:54,080 --> 00:05:55,160
that means

91
00:05:55,240 --> 00:05:58,200
the person sneaking into our pen
is one of Sia Aun's.

92
00:05:59,200 --> 00:06:00,840
You mean

93
00:06:01,480 --> 00:06:02,640
that Sia Aun

94
00:06:03,560 --> 00:06:06,520
has something to do with Yod's death?

95
00:06:20,640 --> 00:06:21,480
Hey!

96
00:06:23,000 --> 00:06:24,320
What's with this buffalo?

97
00:06:24,400 --> 00:06:26,400
We're here to look for Hom Thong.

98
00:06:26,480 --> 00:06:28,520
Let's go find your baby, Hom Ngern.

99
00:06:28,600 --> 00:06:29,840
You can't come in!

100
00:06:31,160 --> 00:06:32,400
This doesn't concern you!

101
00:06:43,400 --> 00:06:45,160
Go get help! Go!

102
00:06:48,440 --> 00:06:49,640
Ouch!

103
00:06:54,240 --> 00:06:55,200
-Let's go.
-Argh!

104
00:06:56,280 --> 00:06:57,200
-Shut up!
-Damn it!

105
00:06:58,400 --> 00:06:59,520
Go!

106
00:07:01,760 --> 00:07:03,920
Which way, Hom Ngern?

107
00:07:05,440 --> 00:07:06,600
That way?

108
00:07:07,360 --> 00:07:08,200
Where are you going?

109
00:07:09,920 --> 00:07:11,440
Ha!

110
00:07:18,080 --> 00:07:21,480
Auem, just go! I'll handle these guys!

111
00:07:21,560 --> 00:07:22,600
Go now!

112
00:07:23,280 --> 00:07:24,600
Come on, quick!

113
00:07:26,760 --> 00:07:28,360
Watch out!

114
00:07:36,040 --> 00:07:37,000
Sia Aun! Sia Aun!

115
00:07:37,800 --> 00:07:39,680
Auem's gang stormed into our rice field.

116
00:07:39,760 --> 00:07:41,960
They have Hom Ngern
looking for her baby too.

117
00:07:47,680 --> 00:07:48,840
Khwanchai.

118
00:07:48,920 --> 00:07:50,240
Don't wait for the truck.

119
00:07:50,320 --> 00:07:52,520
Move Hom Thong
from the warehouse right now.

120
00:07:58,240 --> 00:07:59,320
This way, Hom Ngern?

121
00:07:59,400 --> 00:08:01,120
Is that warehouse where Hom Thong is?

122
00:08:05,000 --> 00:08:06,640
-Quickly, Auem!
-Let go!

123
00:08:19,200 --> 00:08:20,040
Let go!

124
00:08:23,400 --> 00:08:25,600
Get out of my farm now

125
00:08:25,680 --> 00:08:28,000
-or I'll call the cops.
-I'm not leaving.

126
00:08:28,080 --> 00:08:29,920
Hom Thong's in that warehouse, isn't he?

127
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:31,200
Return him to me right now!

128
00:08:31,280 --> 00:08:33,159
I told you he's dead.

129
00:08:33,880 --> 00:08:36,000
Throw this woman and her buffalo out!

130
00:08:37,840 --> 00:08:40,039
No! No! Let go of me!

131
00:08:40,120 --> 00:08:42,440
-Let go! I said let go!
-Go!

132
00:08:42,520 --> 00:08:43,559
Get her out of here.

133
00:08:44,840 --> 00:08:46,640
Auem! Move!

134
00:08:48,160 --> 00:08:49,480
Move! Move!

135
00:08:49,560 --> 00:08:50,600
Jesus!

136
00:08:51,680 --> 00:08:53,440
-What the hell are you doing?
-Dindaen.

137
00:08:53,520 --> 00:08:55,280
-Crash through the fence!
-Wait, stop it!

138
00:08:55,360 --> 00:08:56,920
-Stop!
-Holy crap!

139
00:08:57,640 --> 00:08:58,840
Hom Ngern!

140
00:09:09,520 --> 00:09:10,480
Auem!

141
00:09:11,800 --> 00:09:12,840
-Sia Aun, you!
-Ah!

142
00:09:14,800 --> 00:09:16,520
-Let go of me!
-No way!

143
00:09:17,880 --> 00:09:19,160
Hom Ngern?

144
00:09:19,240 --> 00:09:20,440
Hom Ngern!

145
00:09:36,440 --> 00:09:37,960
Let go of me! Tik! Stop it!

146
00:09:43,000 --> 00:09:44,680
Come here!

147
00:09:48,080 --> 00:09:49,320
Damn it.

148
00:09:49,400 --> 00:09:50,720
Just move!

149
00:09:51,560 --> 00:09:53,880
Why is he so damn stubborn?

150
00:10:05,000 --> 00:10:05,840
Stop fighting!

151
00:10:09,040 --> 00:10:10,080
Hom Thong!

152
00:10:11,040 --> 00:10:13,280
Stop! Don't hurt him!

153
00:10:15,800 --> 00:10:17,560
No! Let me go!

154
00:10:17,640 --> 00:10:18,720
Hom Thong!

155
00:10:19,280 --> 00:10:20,240
Let me go!

156
00:10:20,960 --> 00:10:22,240
Hom Thong!

157
00:10:25,720 --> 00:10:26,600
Quick! Come here!

158
00:10:26,680 --> 00:10:28,000
-Are you okay?
-Walk!

159
00:10:28,080 --> 00:10:29,240
-I'm okay, Din.
-Walk!

160
00:10:29,320 --> 00:10:30,480
Where are you taking him?

161
00:10:34,880 --> 00:10:35,840
Hom Thong!

162
00:10:39,400 --> 00:10:42,000
Hom Thong. You're still alive!

163
00:10:43,480 --> 00:10:45,080
Are you hurt?

164
00:10:45,640 --> 00:10:47,760
I'm here to take you home,
just like I promised.

165
00:11:40,640 --> 00:11:42,280
CHOK CHAROENSUK FARM

166
00:11:42,360 --> 00:11:44,600
Here's the contract
for buying Hom Thong back

167
00:11:44,680 --> 00:11:46,760
and the two million
we previously agreed on.

168
00:11:49,000 --> 00:11:50,880
If you don't take it,

169
00:11:50,960 --> 00:11:52,440
I'll make Auem take her money back.

170
00:11:53,280 --> 00:11:55,440
You tried to pull a scam just now.

171
00:11:55,520 --> 00:11:57,280
Auem shouldn't even have to pay you.

172
00:11:59,320 --> 00:12:02,480
Let's make this deal official then.

173
00:12:02,560 --> 00:12:04,880
Give us back our buffalo
and call it a day.

174
00:12:38,480 --> 00:12:39,520
Here.

175
00:12:43,480 --> 00:12:47,200
Alright, everything's now in order.

176
00:12:47,720 --> 00:12:49,360
And from now on,

177
00:12:50,120 --> 00:12:52,400
I hope you'll stay away from my niece.

178
00:12:56,760 --> 00:12:59,640
If you want to compete with me after this,

179
00:12:59,720 --> 00:13:03,800
let's compete fair and square in the ring.
No more dirty tricks.

180
00:13:20,880 --> 00:13:22,400
-All good, Auem?
-Yeah.

181
00:13:23,600 --> 00:13:25,520
Come on, Hom Ngern, Hom Thong.

182
00:13:25,600 --> 00:13:26,760
Let's go home.

183
00:13:27,840 --> 00:13:29,560
We're going home, okay?

184
00:13:30,080 --> 00:13:32,480
Time to go home.

185
00:13:32,560 --> 00:13:34,160
Let's go home.

186
00:13:35,280 --> 00:13:36,400
Come on.

187
00:13:37,000 --> 00:13:38,120
Let's go.

188
00:13:38,200 --> 00:13:39,320
Come on, quick.

189
00:13:40,520 --> 00:13:41,960
Let's go home.

190
00:13:43,320 --> 00:13:44,560
You don't wanna go?

191
00:13:46,280 --> 00:13:48,080
BOONYOD FARM

192
00:13:51,080 --> 00:13:52,000
Alright.

193
00:13:55,400 --> 00:13:56,920
Hom Thong, you okay?

194
00:13:57,000 --> 00:13:58,600
Did you miss your pen here at all?

195
00:13:58,680 --> 00:13:59,800
Auem and I

196
00:13:59,880 --> 00:14:02,600
cleaned it nicely
to welcome you back home.

197
00:14:02,680 --> 00:14:03,520
Yeah.

198
00:14:03,600 --> 00:14:07,320
And I brought you
your favorite bananas too. Come eat!

199
00:14:14,760 --> 00:14:17,800
Dad must be so happy
to see Hom Thong's home.

200
00:14:17,880 --> 00:14:20,640
That's because everyone in our family
pulled their weight.

201
00:14:24,000 --> 00:14:24,840
Right?

202
00:14:27,720 --> 00:14:29,400
Mommy's here.

203
00:14:33,880 --> 00:14:34,720
Look.

204
00:14:34,800 --> 00:14:38,480
Hom Thong, you gotta thank
Mom and Orn too.

205
00:14:38,560 --> 00:14:42,480
They've been working hard
selling meatballs and reviewing products

206
00:14:42,560 --> 00:14:44,640
and making lots of money to buy you back.

207
00:14:44,720 --> 00:14:46,040
Got it?

208
00:14:53,440 --> 00:14:54,880
Mom?

209
00:14:54,960 --> 00:14:56,400
Are you okay?

210
00:14:56,480 --> 00:14:59,440
Aren't you glad
that we got Hom Thong back?

211
00:15:00,200 --> 00:15:01,600
I am.

212
00:15:02,640 --> 00:15:04,640
But I've got to talk to you
about something.

213
00:15:05,920 --> 00:15:07,040
What is it?

214
00:15:11,080 --> 00:15:12,040
It's about your dad.

215
00:15:15,840 --> 00:15:18,720
His death wasn't an accident, was it?

216
00:15:19,880 --> 00:15:20,840
How did you find out?

217
00:15:21,440 --> 00:15:23,080
I told her.

218
00:15:23,160 --> 00:15:26,320
Today, Orn mentioned that she wanted
to make Hom Ngern and Hom Thong

219
00:15:26,400 --> 00:15:28,640
merch samples and pitch them to you.

220
00:15:28,720 --> 00:15:31,080
So we went to a store
that makes stuff like that.

221
00:15:34,800 --> 00:15:35,760
CHOK CHAROENSUK FARM

222
00:15:36,480 --> 00:15:38,640
CHOK CHAROENSUK FARM

223
00:15:38,720 --> 00:15:41,360
It's a keychain from Chok Charoensuk Farm.

224
00:15:41,440 --> 00:15:42,560
Sia Aun's farm.

225
00:15:43,120 --> 00:15:44,720
What is it doing here?

226
00:15:44,800 --> 00:15:46,720
This red mark at the back
looks like blood.

227
00:15:48,880 --> 00:15:51,800
Are you saying that
the bloodstain on the keychain

228
00:15:51,880 --> 00:15:53,920
is one of Sia Aun's men's?

229
00:15:54,000 --> 00:15:56,080
But he's got a lot of men.

230
00:15:56,160 --> 00:15:58,080
How would we know whose blood it is?

231
00:15:59,440 --> 00:16:02,240
If Sia Aun's really behind this,

232
00:16:03,080 --> 00:16:05,360
and we just took Hom Thong from him,

233
00:16:05,440 --> 00:16:07,560
will be you okay, Auem?

234
00:16:07,640 --> 00:16:11,120
When dad was here,
I remember him telling me

235
00:16:11,200 --> 00:16:14,080
that Sia Aun wanted to buy Hom Thong,
but Dad wouldn't sell him.

236
00:16:16,040 --> 00:16:17,520
The day Dad died,

237
00:16:17,600 --> 00:16:20,320
Sia Aun might've sent someone
to steal Hom Thong.

238
00:16:20,920 --> 00:16:22,720
Dad happened to be there.

239
00:16:22,800 --> 00:16:24,640
So he chased after them,

240
00:16:24,720 --> 00:16:26,040
and got hit by a car.

241
00:16:32,960 --> 00:16:34,240
Auem.

242
00:16:34,320 --> 00:16:35,720
Should we stop raising buffaloes?

243
00:16:36,400 --> 00:16:38,200
What if he tries something again?

244
00:16:39,120 --> 00:16:41,600
And I… I'm worried about you.

245
00:16:43,400 --> 00:16:47,000
No, Mom. We just got Hom Thong back.

246
00:16:47,080 --> 00:16:51,200
No matter what happens,
I'll make Dad's buffalo center a reality.

247
00:16:51,960 --> 00:16:53,640
I know.

248
00:16:53,720 --> 00:16:56,960
I know you want to make
his dream come true.

249
00:16:57,560 --> 00:17:01,400
But what if something happened to you?
What would Orn and I do?

250
00:17:02,440 --> 00:17:05,000
Mom, please don't worry.

251
00:17:05,079 --> 00:17:06,480
I'll take care of myself.

252
00:17:08,280 --> 00:17:09,359
Please don't be worried.

253
00:17:10,119 --> 00:17:11,960
I'll help make sure she's okay.

254
00:17:12,040 --> 00:17:13,640
When Uncle Yod was still alive,

255
00:17:13,720 --> 00:17:15,280
he helped me a great deal.

256
00:17:16,560 --> 00:17:18,720
I'll never let a crook like Sia Aun

257
00:17:18,800 --> 00:17:20,240
lay a finger on Auem.

258
00:17:23,880 --> 00:17:26,480
And if that guy really has something
to do with Dad's death,

259
00:17:26,560 --> 00:17:28,000
I won't let him walk away.

260
00:17:29,040 --> 00:17:31,120
Dad's death won't be in vain.

261
00:17:48,000 --> 00:17:50,720
I want to file a report
about the car accident that killed my dad.

262
00:17:51,320 --> 00:17:54,320
I suspected it wasn't because
the buffalo ran out of the pen,

263
00:17:54,400 --> 00:17:57,720
but because someone tried to steal
my dad's buffalo.

264
00:17:58,640 --> 00:17:59,960
What made you think so?

265
00:18:00,560 --> 00:18:03,240
I found this keychain in my buffalo pen

266
00:18:03,320 --> 00:18:04,560
after Dad's death.

267
00:18:04,640 --> 00:18:07,480
So I suspected that the thief

268
00:18:07,560 --> 00:18:09,240
must be its owner.

269
00:18:11,200 --> 00:18:14,920
We already went and looked into it.

270
00:18:15,000 --> 00:18:18,080
This keychain belongs
to Chok Charoensuk Farm,

271
00:18:18,160 --> 00:18:21,560
and it was made
specifically for their staff.

272
00:18:23,760 --> 00:18:26,160
Please arrest them, Officer,

273
00:18:26,240 --> 00:18:27,520
and get their blood tested

274
00:18:27,600 --> 00:18:31,320
so we know who tried to steal my buffalo
and killed my husband.

275
00:18:31,400 --> 00:18:32,840
I'm afraid I can't do that.

276
00:18:32,920 --> 00:18:34,560
Huh? Why not?

277
00:18:34,640 --> 00:18:37,480
The keychain may belong
to one of the workers at that farm,

278
00:18:37,560 --> 00:18:40,160
but it's possible that

279
00:18:40,240 --> 00:18:42,480
they could've given it
to anyone outside the farm.

280
00:18:42,560 --> 00:18:45,400
You said you found the keychain
in the buffalo pen.

281
00:18:45,480 --> 00:18:48,680
You have witnesses, sure,
but you're all friends.

282
00:18:48,760 --> 00:18:51,520
How can I be sure you're not lying to me?

283
00:18:52,480 --> 00:18:55,400
But I really found the keychain
in our buffalo pen!

284
00:18:56,160 --> 00:18:59,120
Well, do you have any photos
or CCTV footage

285
00:18:59,200 --> 00:19:01,160
to prove that this keychain

286
00:19:01,240 --> 00:19:03,440
was really left in your buffalo pen?

287
00:19:06,800 --> 00:19:10,000
And the day your dad was hit by a car,
did anyone see the culprit?

288
00:19:17,760 --> 00:19:18,840
No.

289
00:19:20,160 --> 00:19:22,080
I'd like to help you,

290
00:19:23,320 --> 00:19:26,760
but before we arrest anyone,
we need to be sure,

291
00:19:26,840 --> 00:19:28,400
and we need solid evidence.

292
00:19:29,920 --> 00:19:33,360
This evidence you have
isn't enough to reopen the case.

293
00:19:33,960 --> 00:19:35,200
I'm very sorry.

294
00:19:47,040 --> 00:19:49,120
The cops just don't want to help us.

295
00:19:49,720 --> 00:19:51,880
Is Yod's death going to be in vain?

296
00:19:51,960 --> 00:19:53,520
I won't let that happen, Mom.

297
00:19:55,200 --> 00:19:56,600
Uncle.

298
00:19:56,680 --> 00:19:59,680
We gotta find a way to get DNA samples
from the staff at Sia Aun's farm

299
00:19:59,760 --> 00:20:01,840
and compare them
to the blood on this keychain.

300
00:20:01,920 --> 00:20:03,440
Then we'll have the evidence to nab him.

301
00:20:04,080 --> 00:20:04,920
Auem.

302
00:20:05,000 --> 00:20:08,400
How are we going to secretly take
DNA samples from them?

303
00:20:08,480 --> 00:20:10,320
I'm still trying to figure that out,

304
00:20:10,400 --> 00:20:12,640
but this can't get swept under the rug.

305
00:20:12,720 --> 00:20:14,720
That way, once we've built
the buffalo center,

306
00:20:14,800 --> 00:20:17,440
Sia Aun won't dare
pull something like this again.

307
00:20:19,600 --> 00:20:22,280
Leave this to me.

308
00:20:30,160 --> 00:20:31,280
Hello? Yes, Orn?

309
00:20:31,360 --> 00:20:33,800
Sis, something's wrong with Hom Thong.

310
00:20:35,320 --> 00:20:36,960
Okay. Just come home quick.

311
00:20:38,600 --> 00:20:39,840
Oh no, Ob!

312
00:20:41,160 --> 00:20:42,480
What's happening, Orn?

313
00:20:46,640 --> 00:20:48,680
-That hurts!
-Stop moving away!

314
00:20:48,760 --> 00:20:50,680
Ob. Orn.

315
00:20:50,760 --> 00:20:52,240
What happened?

316
00:20:53,160 --> 00:20:55,680
Gee, that's a big cut.

317
00:20:55,760 --> 00:20:58,080
Something's wrong with Hom Thong.

318
00:20:58,160 --> 00:21:00,520
Orn and I were just cleaning his pen.

319
00:21:00,600 --> 00:21:02,920
We tried to pull him out as usual,

320
00:21:03,000 --> 00:21:04,200
but he wouldn't budge.

321
00:21:05,280 --> 00:21:07,160
Come on, Hom Thong.

322
00:21:07,240 --> 00:21:08,240
Ah!

323
00:21:10,160 --> 00:21:12,880
-What's up with him?
-Is he usually like this?

324
00:21:14,160 --> 00:21:17,040
So I pretended to shoo him
with some fresh grass like I used to do.

325
00:21:19,720 --> 00:21:21,000
Oh no, Ob!

326
00:21:21,080 --> 00:21:23,080
When I pulled him one last time,
he shook me off,

327
00:21:23,160 --> 00:21:24,520
so I fell and got this cut.

328
00:21:25,680 --> 00:21:28,720
Maybe he's in heat
and could smell a female nearby?

329
00:21:28,800 --> 00:21:30,560
But he's not usually like this

330
00:21:30,640 --> 00:21:32,000
when he's in heat, Uncle.

331
00:21:33,280 --> 00:21:34,480
How about

332
00:21:35,240 --> 00:21:38,160
we call Uncle Tik and ask for his advice?

333
00:21:47,120 --> 00:21:48,240
Hello, Uncle Tik.

334
00:21:52,360 --> 00:21:53,240
Hom Thong.

335
00:21:57,400 --> 00:22:00,920
You said he got startled
when you pretended

336
00:22:01,000 --> 00:22:03,160
-to hit him with the grass?
-Yes, Uncle.

337
00:22:13,160 --> 00:22:15,000
Come here, Hom Thong.

338
00:22:19,040 --> 00:22:20,080
Come here.

339
00:22:20,960 --> 00:22:22,000
Hom Thong.

340
00:22:24,600 --> 00:22:26,120
-Ouch!
-Uncle!

341
00:22:26,920 --> 00:22:27,880
I'm okay.

342
00:22:30,000 --> 00:22:31,360
What's wrong with Hom Thong?

343
00:22:31,440 --> 00:22:32,800
He's never acted like this.

344
00:22:35,120 --> 00:22:37,640
I think when he was with Sia Aun,

345
00:22:37,720 --> 00:22:39,360
someone must've hit him.

346
00:22:39,960 --> 00:22:43,240
So when someone acts like
he's about to hit him

347
00:22:43,320 --> 00:22:45,400
or pulls him harshly,

348
00:22:45,480 --> 00:22:47,400
he thinks he might get hit again.

349
00:22:47,480 --> 00:22:48,960
You're right.

350
00:22:49,040 --> 00:22:52,440
The day we rescued Hom Thong,
Uncle Khwanchai really pulled on his rope.

351
00:22:54,440 --> 00:22:56,280
Let me go! Hom Thong!

352
00:23:00,000 --> 00:23:02,400
Will he ever get over this fear?

353
00:23:03,240 --> 00:23:05,320
He will, but it'll take time.

354
00:23:06,080 --> 00:23:07,320
Buffaloes are just like us.

355
00:23:07,400 --> 00:23:11,000
They remember the traumas
they've been through.

356
00:23:11,880 --> 00:23:13,920
From now on,
we've got to take good care of him.

357
00:23:14,000 --> 00:23:17,280
Make him feel that he's safe
and that we can protect him,

358
00:23:17,360 --> 00:23:18,520
and he'll be better.

359
00:23:26,200 --> 00:23:27,280
Hom Thong.

360
00:23:32,280 --> 00:23:35,200
I'm sorry I put you through all that
with those awful people.

361
00:23:36,240 --> 00:23:37,760
But don't you worry.

362
00:23:38,280 --> 00:23:41,080
No one here will hurt you
the way Sia Aun did.

363
00:23:44,360 --> 00:23:45,560
That's right.

364
00:23:46,520 --> 00:23:48,640
I'll keep you safe, Hom Thong.

365
00:23:50,520 --> 00:23:51,840
Please get better soon.

366
00:23:57,400 --> 00:23:59,120
You guys too.

367
00:23:59,200 --> 00:24:02,120
For now, don't raise your hands
like you're going to hit him.

368
00:24:02,200 --> 00:24:03,800
And don't pull him too hard.

369
00:24:23,520 --> 00:24:25,880
Hey, Hom Ngern and Hom Thong.

370
00:24:25,960 --> 00:24:30,160
Din just installed CCTV for us today.

371
00:24:30,680 --> 00:24:31,720
Know what I'm saying?

372
00:24:46,200 --> 00:24:47,560
Is this okay?

373
00:24:48,160 --> 00:24:49,400
One sec.

374
00:24:50,880 --> 00:24:52,400
Yep, looking good.

375
00:24:52,480 --> 00:24:55,040
I can clearly see
Hom Ngern's and Hom Thong's pens.

376
00:24:55,120 --> 00:24:57,000
-I'll put it here then.
-Okay.

377
00:24:59,680 --> 00:25:02,160
Done.

378
00:25:05,240 --> 00:25:07,320
You know,

379
00:25:07,400 --> 00:25:10,560
we should have another camera here
so we can see the front of the pens too.

380
00:25:10,640 --> 00:25:13,280
If Sia Aun comes here
and tries to pull anything again,

381
00:25:13,360 --> 00:25:15,600
we'll have evidence
to file a police report.

382
00:25:15,680 --> 00:25:17,080
Good idea.

383
00:25:18,240 --> 00:25:21,680
Oh, Auem. I think

384
00:25:21,760 --> 00:25:24,360
you should have Hom Ngern
and Hom Thong microchipped.

385
00:25:24,440 --> 00:25:25,640
What?

386
00:25:25,720 --> 00:25:26,800
Wait.

387
00:25:26,880 --> 00:25:28,680
Buffaloes can get chipped too?

388
00:25:28,760 --> 00:25:30,480
Of course!

389
00:25:30,560 --> 00:25:32,000
Phetkla and Saiphet are too.

390
00:25:32,920 --> 00:25:34,920
Actually, before Uncle Yod passed,

391
00:25:35,000 --> 00:25:37,200
he was about to get these two chipped.

392
00:25:41,080 --> 00:25:42,680
Oh.

393
00:25:44,160 --> 00:25:45,200
And

394
00:25:45,720 --> 00:25:47,640
where would the chip go?

395
00:25:47,720 --> 00:25:50,240
Under the skin.
Just above the shoulder blade

396
00:25:50,320 --> 00:25:52,600
or on the front of the leg.

397
00:25:52,680 --> 00:25:54,200
The base of the tail's good too.

398
00:25:55,240 --> 00:25:57,000
Is it gonna hurt?

399
00:25:57,080 --> 00:25:58,320
If it does,

400
00:25:58,400 --> 00:26:01,880
I'm worried that Hom Thong might think
we're trying to hurt him.

401
00:26:01,960 --> 00:26:03,880
I'll ask Dr. Sun.

402
00:26:03,960 --> 00:26:05,560
But I strongly suggest

403
00:26:05,640 --> 00:26:06,920
that you chip your buffaloes.

404
00:26:07,000 --> 00:26:09,200
The microchip can give us
all the information.

405
00:26:09,280 --> 00:26:12,840
Buffalo's name, owner's name,

406
00:26:12,920 --> 00:26:14,600
buffalo's age, date of birth,

407
00:26:14,680 --> 00:26:16,560
height, weight, literally everything.

408
00:26:16,640 --> 00:26:20,120
It can even tell you
what prizes the buffalo has won.

409
00:26:20,200 --> 00:26:22,480
More importantly, it'll deter thieves.

410
00:26:24,520 --> 00:26:28,000
Okay. I should have them chipped then,

411
00:26:28,080 --> 00:26:30,400
so Hom Ngern and Hom Thong can be safe.

412
00:26:32,080 --> 00:26:34,520
Well, have you thought about

413
00:26:34,600 --> 00:26:36,440
what you're doing next

414
00:26:36,520 --> 00:26:37,760
now that Hom Thong's back?

415
00:26:38,800 --> 00:26:40,040
I already have an idea.

416
00:26:40,120 --> 00:26:42,800
I was actually going to talk
to you and Uncle Tik about it.

417
00:26:42,880 --> 00:26:46,320
We have five buffaloes here
at Dan Dao Farm.

418
00:26:46,400 --> 00:26:48,480
Three males and two females.

419
00:26:48,560 --> 00:26:51,560
Right now, we can only
sell Phetkla's semen.

420
00:26:51,640 --> 00:26:54,000
As for Hom Thong,
we'll have to wait another three years

421
00:26:54,080 --> 00:26:55,520
before his semen is good enough.

422
00:26:55,600 --> 00:26:56,760
So I think

423
00:26:56,840 --> 00:27:00,120
I'm going to take his competition career
to the next level.

424
00:27:00,200 --> 00:27:02,200
Do you think that's a good idea?

425
00:27:02,280 --> 00:27:03,280
Absolutely.

426
00:27:03,960 --> 00:27:07,600
You've got to make sure
he wins at lots of competitions though.

427
00:27:07,680 --> 00:27:10,080
That'll prove how good he is.

428
00:27:10,160 --> 00:27:13,760
When we start selling his semen,
it'll be well-known and in high demand,

429
00:27:13,840 --> 00:27:15,640
and we'll get more income.

430
00:27:16,880 --> 00:27:20,200
Right now it's the rainy season.
Barely any competitions are going on.

431
00:27:20,280 --> 00:27:23,040
We have to get Hom Thong back
to his old self as soon as possible.

432
00:27:23,120 --> 00:27:25,000
If he freaks out while competing,

433
00:27:25,080 --> 00:27:27,920
it could affect our reputation.

434
00:27:29,240 --> 00:27:30,760
Oh, Uncle.

435
00:27:30,840 --> 00:27:34,560
With male buffaloes,
there are plenty of ways to make money.

436
00:27:34,640 --> 00:27:37,840
But what about female buffaloes
that are not for show like Hom Ngern?

437
00:27:37,920 --> 00:27:40,840
Is there any way to make money from them?

438
00:27:40,920 --> 00:27:42,800
Female buffaloes

439
00:27:43,480 --> 00:27:45,760
can make us money by producing calves.

440
00:27:46,680 --> 00:27:48,600
But buffaloes take forever to give birth.

441
00:27:48,680 --> 00:27:50,120
Only one calf a year.

442
00:27:50,960 --> 00:27:54,400
What you said may be true,

443
00:27:54,480 --> 00:27:55,640
but

444
00:27:55,720 --> 00:27:58,720
a good breeding female

445
00:27:58,800 --> 00:28:02,600
should produce a calf every year,
and every calf is a beauty.

446
00:28:02,680 --> 00:28:05,760
This is how we can make money
from breeding females.

447
00:28:06,800 --> 00:28:09,160
But we can sell
male buffaloes' semen every month.

448
00:28:09,240 --> 00:28:12,800
How can breeding females
compete with that?

449
00:28:12,880 --> 00:28:16,560
Think about it, Ob.
What if our champion gets dethroned?

450
00:28:16,640 --> 00:28:18,720
What if there are better male buffaloes?

451
00:28:19,440 --> 00:28:21,920
Then our income
from semen sales would drop.

452
00:28:22,000 --> 00:28:23,560
You know, it's possible

453
00:28:23,640 --> 00:28:26,240
that female buffaloes
can make us even more money.

454
00:28:27,600 --> 00:28:29,560
Uncle Tik's got a point.

455
00:28:29,640 --> 00:28:33,320
If we have Hom Ngern
mated with other bulls

456
00:28:33,400 --> 00:28:35,440
and the calves turn out so nice

457
00:28:35,520 --> 00:28:38,760
that we can keep improving the bloodline
and producing nice calves,

458
00:28:38,840 --> 00:28:41,760
people will surely want Hom Ngern
to be their breeding female.

459
00:28:43,160 --> 00:28:46,640
You mean I'll need to find a breeding bull
to mate with Hom Ngern

460
00:28:46,720 --> 00:28:48,000
to get calves, right?

461
00:28:48,080 --> 00:28:49,200
Correct.

462
00:28:49,840 --> 00:28:53,600
But here's my advice.
You don't need an expensive breeding bull.

463
00:28:54,160 --> 00:28:56,480
Based on Hom Ngern's build,

464
00:28:57,480 --> 00:29:01,320
I'm sure that if she mates with Phetkla,
she'll have a beautiful calf.

465
00:29:03,960 --> 00:29:05,960
Then let's wait
until Hom Ngern goes into heat,

466
00:29:06,040 --> 00:29:08,400
and we'll breed her with Phetkla.

467
00:29:12,120 --> 00:29:14,680
These five buffaloes
will help me pay off Dad's debts

468
00:29:15,280 --> 00:29:17,320
and take Dad's dream even further.

469
00:29:25,560 --> 00:29:26,880
PHETKLA
DAN DAO FARM

470
00:29:31,000 --> 00:29:33,120
100% BUFFALO MILK YOGURT

471
00:29:35,760 --> 00:29:37,280
PHETKLA
POR CHANG

472
00:29:40,560 --> 00:29:42,200
DAN DAO FARM

473
00:30:27,400 --> 00:30:29,200
Hello!

474
00:30:29,280 --> 00:30:32,240
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">This makes a cool oversized T-shirt.</font></font></i>

475
00:30:32,320 --> 00:30:34,160
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">You can also…</font></font></i>

476
00:30:34,240 --> 00:30:38,040
DAN DAO FARM

477
00:30:40,720 --> 00:30:41,960
CHOK CHAROENSUK FARM

478
00:30:44,720 --> 00:30:48,040
What's this massive drop
in our souvenir sales?

479
00:30:49,680 --> 00:30:51,600
I'm asking you a question! Are you deaf?

480
00:30:52,360 --> 00:30:53,280
Uh…

481
00:30:53,360 --> 00:30:55,080
It's probably because of this.

482
00:30:57,160 --> 00:31:01,120
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">Alright, everyone.</font></font></i>
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">Here's our 99-baht canvas bag.</font></font></i>

483
00:31:01,200 --> 00:31:04,200
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">This cute keychain is 89 baht.</font></font></i>

484
00:31:04,280 --> 00:31:07,320
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">And here are Hom Thong</font></font></i>
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">and Por Chang T-shirts.</font></font></i>

485
00:31:11,680 --> 00:31:13,120
I also heard that

486
00:31:13,680 --> 00:31:15,760
Auem's almost paid off all her debts.

487
00:31:17,080 --> 00:31:19,960
If she can actually build
that buffalo center thing,

488
00:31:20,040 --> 00:31:21,640
she might become our rival.

489
00:31:23,920 --> 00:31:27,160
If you already knew,
why didn't you do anything about it?

490
00:31:27,760 --> 00:31:28,640
I'm sorry, boss.

491
00:31:28,720 --> 00:31:31,920
Find someone to compete with them
in livestream sales.

492
00:31:32,440 --> 00:31:34,520
I won't be threatened by that tiny farm.

493
00:31:34,600 --> 00:31:35,680
Got it.

494
00:31:36,800 --> 00:31:37,800
And

495
00:31:37,880 --> 00:31:41,120
have you gotten the frickin' stuff
we're donating to the school ready yet?

496
00:31:41,200 --> 00:31:42,360
Yes, boss.

497
00:31:42,880 --> 00:31:44,560
Remember this. For someone like me,

498
00:31:45,200 --> 00:31:47,920
losing money isn't a problem.
Losing face is.

499
00:32:02,240 --> 00:32:03,720
I transferred you the money.

500
00:32:03,800 --> 00:32:04,680
TRANSFER SUCCESSFUL
200,000 BAHT

501
00:32:05,520 --> 00:32:09,000
We really appreciate you helping Dad out
when he was struggling, Uncle Tom.

502
00:32:09,080 --> 00:32:12,560
That's okay. He'd helped me before too.

503
00:32:13,080 --> 00:32:15,480
You've done really well.
It's been less than a year,

504
00:32:15,560 --> 00:32:17,560
but you've already paid off a lot.

505
00:32:19,000 --> 00:32:22,480
Don't leave just yet. Hang on!

506
00:32:22,560 --> 00:32:26,280
Here are some meatballs for you, Tom.

507
00:32:26,360 --> 00:32:30,320
They're really good.
Consider these the interest on your loan.

508
00:32:30,400 --> 00:32:31,520
Okay.

509
00:32:31,600 --> 00:32:33,600
Right, I'm off then.

510
00:32:33,680 --> 00:32:35,920
-Goodbye.
-Goodbye.

511
00:32:39,840 --> 00:32:43,400
We've paid off what we owed Uncle Tom.
Now all that's left is our debt

512
00:32:43,960 --> 00:32:46,280
to Aunt Ying and Aunt Pom, right?

513
00:32:46,360 --> 00:32:50,640
Yeah. That's around 700,000 in total.

514
00:32:50,720 --> 00:32:53,440
Hey, thank you all so much

515
00:32:53,520 --> 00:32:55,120
for doing this with me.

516
00:32:56,240 --> 00:32:59,600
No problem, dear.

517
00:32:59,680 --> 00:33:01,640
But can I have 500 baht?

518
00:33:01,720 --> 00:33:05,400
My fingers are all stiff
from kneading the meatball mixture.

519
00:33:05,480 --> 00:33:06,960
Please?

520
00:33:07,480 --> 00:33:10,160
-Don't worry. I'll give you a massage.
-What?

521
00:33:10,240 --> 00:33:11,600
-A massage.
-Nah.

522
00:33:11,680 --> 00:33:14,920
-Orn, come help me.
-Why are your hands so coarse?

523
00:33:15,000 --> 00:33:16,520
Alright. Come right here, Mom.

524
00:33:16,600 --> 00:33:17,440
What?

525
00:33:17,520 --> 00:33:19,640
-Put your elbow into it.
-Guys.

526
00:33:20,240 --> 00:33:21,400
Not long now.

527
00:33:21,480 --> 00:33:25,560
Once we've paid off all of Dad's debts,
I'll buy back his land,

528
00:33:25,640 --> 00:33:29,200
and I'll build Dad's
buffalo conservation center there.

529
00:33:30,240 --> 00:33:31,480
Give me 500.

530
00:33:32,120 --> 00:33:33,000
Mom!

531
00:33:34,160 --> 00:33:35,480
For your soccer game.

532
00:33:35,560 --> 00:33:37,920
THE CHOK CHAROENSUK FARM PROJECT
SHARING FOR THE YOUTH

533
00:33:39,960 --> 00:33:41,560
Do you know how to play table tennis?

534
00:33:41,640 --> 00:33:45,000
Like this. This is perfect for you.

535
00:33:49,480 --> 00:33:51,720
CHOK CHAROENSUK FARM

536
00:34:04,040 --> 00:34:04,920
-Auem.
-Hmm?

537
00:34:05,000 --> 00:34:07,960
I've already arranged for Dr. Sun to come.
He'll be here on Friday.

538
00:34:08,040 --> 00:34:10,960
He'll look into the microchipping
and see if Hom Ngern's ready

539
00:34:11,040 --> 00:34:13,679
-for breeding.
-Okay.

540
00:34:23,639 --> 00:34:25,480
-Hey, Dad.
-Din.

541
00:34:26,199 --> 00:34:30,040
I'm at the charity event
where Sia Aun's donating stuff to kids.

542
00:34:30,120 --> 00:34:33,760
I noticed that Khwanchai
and his staff here

543
00:34:33,840 --> 00:34:37,360
have the exact same keychain.
Sia Aun has one too.

544
00:34:37,960 --> 00:34:38,880
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">Oh, yeah.</font></font></i>

545
00:34:38,960 --> 00:34:40,080
I also heard that

546
00:34:40,159 --> 00:34:42,760
the school's throwing them
a thank-you dinner this evening.

547
00:34:43,600 --> 00:34:46,840
You mean you're gonna try
and take their DNA samples

548
00:34:46,920 --> 00:34:48,040
during dinner?

549
00:34:48,120 --> 00:34:50,360
Yeah. I'll need your help.

550
00:34:50,960 --> 00:34:53,960
Got it. Just send me the location.
I'll be there.

551
00:34:54,040 --> 00:34:55,000
Okay, son.

552
00:35:00,680 --> 00:35:03,240
Your dad found a way
to get those guys' DNA samples?

553
00:35:03,320 --> 00:35:04,880
Yeah. I'm going to go help him now.

554
00:35:04,960 --> 00:35:06,960
-I'll come with you.
-It's okay, Auem.

555
00:35:07,600 --> 00:35:10,440
This is dangerous.
Dad and I will handle it.

556
00:35:10,520 --> 00:35:11,600
But…

557
00:35:12,240 --> 00:35:13,760
Don't worry.

558
00:35:13,840 --> 00:35:15,960
I'll help you take Sia Aun down.

559
00:35:16,760 --> 00:35:19,400
Not just for the buffalo center
and our buffaloes,

560
00:35:19,480 --> 00:35:21,520
but also for the villagers' buffalo farms.

561
00:35:22,680 --> 00:35:24,440
I'll never let that bastard Sia Aun

562
00:35:24,960 --> 00:35:26,520
steal anyone's buffaloes again.

563
00:35:30,240 --> 00:35:33,320
Then please be careful, both of you.

564
00:35:34,320 --> 00:35:35,160
Okay.

565
00:35:36,080 --> 00:35:37,200
I'm gonna go now.

566
00:35:47,720 --> 00:35:51,400
Excuse me, teachers. I'd like

567
00:35:51,480 --> 00:35:53,440
-to take a selfie with you,
-Oh, sure.

568
00:35:53,520 --> 00:35:56,320
so I can show my wife
that I'm really here at the dinner party.

569
00:35:58,640 --> 00:36:00,600
Alright!

570
00:36:00,680 --> 00:36:02,120
One, two, three…

571
00:36:03,280 --> 00:36:04,160
-Thanks.
-Sure.

572
00:36:07,080 --> 00:36:08,000
Oh.

573
00:36:09,400 --> 00:36:13,240
Excuse me. May I take a selfie with you?

574
00:36:13,920 --> 00:36:16,000
Come on, let's get one.

575
00:36:19,800 --> 00:36:23,080
Okay. One, two, three. One more, please.

576
00:36:25,160 --> 00:36:26,640
Alright.

577
00:36:27,520 --> 00:36:28,440
Here.

578
00:36:29,480 --> 00:36:31,600
-I'll send you the photo later.
-Sure.

579
00:36:44,040 --> 00:36:45,680
Give these pandan drinks to everyone.

580
00:36:47,800 --> 00:36:48,640
Here.

581
00:36:49,240 --> 00:36:52,280
Give Sia Aun the glass with a red straw.

582
00:36:52,360 --> 00:36:55,040
The one with a green straw
is for the guy on the right.

583
00:36:55,640 --> 00:36:56,560
White straw for him.

584
00:36:58,160 --> 00:36:59,360
Purple for this guy.

585
00:37:01,280 --> 00:37:02,320
And yellow for this guy.

586
00:37:02,840 --> 00:37:05,240
-Exactly these colors.
-Got it.

587
00:37:05,320 --> 00:37:07,960
Do not mix up the four straw colors.

588
00:37:08,040 --> 00:37:10,040
You can give the white straws to anyone.

589
00:37:10,120 --> 00:37:11,440
-Got it?
-Got it.

590
00:37:28,560 --> 00:37:29,800
Excuse me.

591
00:37:32,320 --> 00:37:33,480
What's this?

592
00:37:33,560 --> 00:37:35,880
-I didn't order this.
-Uh, these are pandan drinks.

593
00:37:35,960 --> 00:37:37,320
They're from Phuyai Dech.

594
00:37:38,440 --> 00:37:39,760
Oh!

595
00:37:40,720 --> 00:37:44,240
You see, Sia Aun. Sa-Ang's been learning
to make pandan drinks,

596
00:37:44,320 --> 00:37:47,120
so I brought some for everyone to try.

597
00:37:47,200 --> 00:37:49,360
If they're good,
we might start selling them.

598
00:37:49,440 --> 00:37:52,200
Go on, have a taste. Please try some.

599
00:37:52,280 --> 00:37:53,360
Please.

600
00:38:08,400 --> 00:38:10,040
-All done?
-Yes.

601
00:38:10,120 --> 00:38:11,960
I'll collect them when they're done.

602
00:38:13,880 --> 00:38:16,080
-A little gift for you. Thanks.
-Thank you.

603
00:38:23,920 --> 00:38:25,680
HOW'S IT GOING? EVERYTHING OKAY?

604
00:38:25,760 --> 00:38:27,440
EVERYTHING'S BEEN TAKEN CARE…

605
00:38:29,440 --> 00:38:32,360
Everything's been taken care of, Auem.
Don't worry about it.

606
00:38:34,320 --> 00:38:36,280
Din said everything's taken care of.

607
00:38:38,160 --> 00:38:41,000
He's helping us find the guys
who tried to steal you two that day.

608
00:38:41,080 --> 00:38:43,920
Hom Thong, you'll have to get back
to your old self. Okay?

609
00:38:45,920 --> 00:38:47,200
Alright.

610
00:38:47,800 --> 00:38:49,400
Let's review the lesson.

611
00:38:49,480 --> 00:38:51,600
How to pose Hom Thong in the show ring.

612
00:38:52,640 --> 00:38:53,680
Okay.

613
00:38:53,760 --> 00:38:56,040
-Stop it! Stop it right there!
-No, honey!

614
00:38:56,120 --> 00:38:57,040
-No!
-Stop running!

615
00:38:57,120 --> 00:38:58,880
I told you to stop, damn it!

616
00:38:58,960 --> 00:39:00,320
Ouch!

617
00:40:32,400 --> 00:40:35,120
Subtitle translation by:
Narawan Promprakai
